<p>Heya.</p>
<p>To boil this down, it seems to be a researcher experiencing a k-class scenario. We have quite a few tales and canons set in situations like this, as well as SCP-5000. So how are you going to make yours unique, what is going to make me want to read this tale about an apocalypse rather than others?</p>
<p>This previous point ties into your hook. Just having to &quot;survive&quot; isn't inherently interesting, what is his goal or is he just aimless, what logical conclusion do you want the tale to have. Alternatively, is there something about him being a containment engineer that makes the story special? Add something to develop your story and the character further.</p>
<p>Hope this helped.</p>

