<p>Special Containment Procedures:</p>
<p>SCP-5127 is kept in site 19 and to be kept in a 15 by15 meter room guarded by two guards out side of the container to avoid containment breach.</p>
<p>There are to be two back up generators within 100 meters of SCP-5127’s containment. No SCP’s are allowed within 150 meters of SCP-5127 including any unauthorized personnel (Class D is allowed for testing).</p>
<p>All guards guarding SCP-5127 are to be striped of any electrical equipment and are to put the equipment in a steel box out side of the 100 meter parameters.</p>
<p>SCP-5127 is to have entertainment at all times to avoid boredom which unconsciously causes a electromagnetic pulse which can cause a containment breach.</p>
<p>Description:<br />
SCP-5127 is what appears to be a fourteen year old girl who has the ability to cause lethal electromagnetic pulses uncontrollably this is prevented by SCP-5127 having entertainment to prevent boredom. SCP-5127 also has a defense mechanism in which (if pierced by metal) causes an electrical shock killing the holder of the metal (see incident 5127-1) SCP-5127 immediately feels guilt after death of personnel except Class D personnel. Researchers assigned to SCP-5127 noted SCP-5127 is aware of Class D’s actions and knows there in the foundation as testing for a reason</p>

